{
  "id": "1173",
  "title": "Online Class",
  "level": "newbie",
  "date": "2021-01-20",
  "synopsis": "Little Ming wants to teach his classmates a trick for online classes.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1173/1f0b6bd546ad396cc08f3d923ebc28a98fad28cb.mp3?1607681194",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "网课\n\n小明：妈妈，我可以用你的手机吗？\n妈妈：不可以，你每天用手机的时间太长了。\n小明：今天我不是玩手机，我要用手机上课。\n妈妈：我怎么不知道你今天有网课？你的老师没告诉我。\n小明：因为今天我是老师！我要给“同学们”讲怎么在上网课的时候，让老师觉得你没在玩手机。\n妈妈：你！你……我要给你的老师打个电话了！",
    "traditional": "網課\n\n小明：媽媽，我可以用你的手機嗎？\n媽媽：不可以，你每天用手機的時間太長了。\n小明：今天我不是玩手機，我要用手機上課。\n媽媽：我怎麼不知道你今天有網課？你的老師沒告訴我。\n小明：因為今天我是老師！我要給“同學們”講怎麼在上網課的時候，讓老師覺得你沒在玩手機。\n媽媽：你！你……我要給你的老師打個電話了！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Online Class"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小明：妈妈，我可以用你的手机吗？",
      "traditional": "小明：媽媽，我可以用你的手機嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng mā ma wǒ kě yǐ yòng nǐ de shǒu jī ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: Mom, can I use your cellphone?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "妈妈：不可以，你每天用手机的时间太长了。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：不可以，你每天用手機的時間太長了。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma bù kě yǐ nǐ měi tiān yòng shǒu jī de shí jiān tài cháng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: No, you spend too much time using the cellphone every day."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小明：今天我不是玩手机，我要用手机上课。",
      "traditional": "小明：今天我不是玩手機，我要用手機上課。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng jīn tiān wǒ bú shì wán shǒu jī wǒ yào yòng shǒu jī shàng kè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Ming: I’m not playing with the cellphone today, I have to use the cellphone for class."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "妈妈：我怎么不知道你今天有网课？你的老师没告诉我。",
      "traditional": "媽媽：我怎麼不知道你今天有網課？你的老師沒告訴我。",
      "pinyin": "mā ma wǒ zěn me bù zhī dào nǐ jīn tiān yǒu wǎng kè nǐ de lǎo shī méi gào su wǒ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: Why didn’t I know that you have an online class today? Your teacher didn’t tell me."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小明：因为今天我是老师！",
      "traditional": "小明：因為今天我是老師！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo míng yīn wèi jīn tiān wǒ shì lǎo shī",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我要给“同学们”讲怎么在上网课的时候，让老师觉得你没在玩手机。",
      "traditional": "我要給“同學們”講怎麼在上網課的時候，讓老師覺得你沒在玩手機。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yào gěi tóng xué men jiǎng zěn me zài shang wǎng kè de shí hou ràng lǎo shī jué de nǐ méi zài wán shǒu jī",
      "english": "Little Ming: That’s because I’m the teacher today!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m going to explain to the “students” how to make the teacher think you’re not playing with your cellphone during an online class."
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "妈妈：你！你……我要给你的老师打个电话了！",
      "traditional": "媽媽：你！你……我要給你的老師打個電話了！",
      "pinyin": "mā ma nǐ nǐ wǒ yào gěi nǐ de lǎo shī dǎ ge diàn huà le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Mom: You! You … I’m going to give your teacher a phone call!"
    }
  ],
